            "review_title": "Review at Mamma Indian Restaurant Conference & Tea",
            "review_text": "Black_Father\nKungsbacka, Sweden1617 contributions\n0\nLife-threatening handling of allergies\nOct 2023 • Family\nAverage Indian restaurant. The menu contains the most common dishes and what is served is perfectly fine. What definitely drags the rating down is the handling of allergies. Indicate very carefully that there must not be any peanuts in the food due to allergy. When the dish in question is served, it is full of peanuts. Saying again that we want a dish without peanuts. Then the first dish comes back in, only the visible peanuts at the top of the dish have been removed. Completely life threatening.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten October 30, 2023",
